OL,3,AEd Sheeran says it was 'not my
OL,4,Adecision' to drop Macklemore from tour
OL,5,
OL,6,FEd Sheeran has posted a long statement
OL,7,Fon Instagram, saying it was not his
OL,8,Fdecision to drop Macklemore from his
OL,9,Fcurrent US tour.
OL,11,FThe US rapper - whose real name is
OL,12,FBenjamin Haggerty - was ejected from
OL,13,Fthe line-up after making
OL,14,Fpro-Palestinian statements at two dates
OL,15,Fin New Jersey.
OL,17,FHis comments drew criticism from Jewish
OL,18,Fgroups, after which some venues put
OL,19,Fpressure on the tour promoters to have
OL,20,Fhim removed from the line-up.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
